=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_2d9f — Standard split, dinner 19–21, glasses at coffee table (fork of p_a1b2)

This fork corrects two things the evidence has now contradicted in the parent. First, the dinner window: the parent placed plates and glasses at the dining table 18:30–20:00, but the sightings show Elena's plate, glass, and water bottle all at dining_table_d1 at 20:00, and Priya's glass and water bottle at the table at 19:00 and 21:00. Dinner clearly runs 19:00–21:00. Second, the parent's glasses_priya ON_PERSON block (7:00–22:00) failed on three sightings; the glasses are actually at the coffee table during Priya's afternoon and evening (15:00, 16:00, 20:00, 21:00, 22:00) and back at the nightstand by 23:00. I have moved them to coffee_table_l1 for 14:00–22:30. I also add the dog food bag moving to the kitchen floor 19:00–21:00 for the evening feeding (sightings at floor_k_k1 at 19:00, 20:00, 21:00). Everything else—the commute split, the entry gear, the morning routine—stays as in the parent.

What sets this apart from p_a1b2: the dinner window is an hour later (19–21 vs 18.5–20), and Priya's glasses are on the coffee table, not on her person. What would refute it: the glasses sighted ON_PERSON at 16:00, or Elena's plate at the dining table at 18:00.

